{%- comment -%}
BLACK WEEK 2026 · board 08 · "Kundfavoriter" accordion on the product page (Impact accordion markup, so it opens
and closes like "Beskrivelse"): up to 4 available products from a collection as Black Week product cards, 2 per row,
the current product left out. Params: product · handle (collection, default cross-traeningbestsellers)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign bw_coll = collections[handle] | default: collections['bestsellers'] -%}
{%- assign bw_n = 0 -%}
{%- capture bw_cards -%}
  {%- for p in bw_coll.products limit: 16 -%}
    {%- if bw_n >= 4 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if p.available == false or p.id == product.id -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- render 'bw-product-card', product: p, offer_only: true -%}
    {%- assign bw_n = bw_n | plus: 1 -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if bw_n > 0 -%}
  <details class="product-info__accordion accordion group" aria-expanded="false" is="accordion-disclosure">
    <summary><div class="accordion__toggle bold"><div class="text-with-icon"><span>Kundfavoriter</span></div></div></summary>
    <div class="accordion__content"><div class="bw bw-pdp-favs">{{ bw_cards }}</div></div>
  </details>
{%- endif -%}
